---
// src/pages/maintenance.astro
// Maintenance Mode Splash Page
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Under Scheduled Maintenance — RealSarkariExam</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/src/styles/global.css" />
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 font-sans">
  <div class="max-w-md w-full bg-slate-850 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-3xl p-8 text-center shadow-2xl">
    
    <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/20 border border-amber-500/40 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mx-auto mb-6 shadow-inner animate-pulse">
      ⚙️
    </div>

    <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider rounded-full mb-3">
      System Upgrades in Progress
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-3">
      We'll Be Right Back!
    </h1>

    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      RealSarkariExam is currently undergoing routine server maintenance and database optimizations to provide faster, uninterrupted government recruitment updates.
    </p>

    <div class="bg-slate-900/60 rounded-xl p-4 border border-slate-700/60 text-xs text-slate-400 mb-6 text-left space-y-1.5">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-200">Database & Crawler sync active</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-400"></span>
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-200">Estimated duration: ~15 minutes</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">
      Need urgent support? Email us at <a href="mailto:contact@realsarkariexam.com" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">contact@realsarkariexam.com</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
